          "name": "How do you stop search engines from indexing temporary session inboxes?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Add wildcard exclusion directives to your robots.txt file (e.g., Disallow: /*?session=* and Disallow: /*?token=*). Additionally, ensure internal links generated by client-side JavaScript do not output crawlable <a href=\"...\"> anchors containing dynamic session parameters."
          }
